{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Delay"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Retries the upstream ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" up to a specified number of times only when a specific error occurs.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"retry"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"retries"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt","preciseIdentifier":"s:Su"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"on"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"error"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryOn","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RetryOn","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7RetryOnC"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/RetryByCountStrategy","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RetryByCountStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent20RetryByCountStrategyC"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":" :